blurb: |
  <p>
    GT's triple triangle is one of the more recognizable frame designs out there, and this Force
    wears it well in deep metallic blue. The frame and fork were in great shape, so the goal was to
    keep the look of the bike and give it a drivetrain that shifts like a modern road bike.
  </p>
  <p>
    We built it up with Shimano 10 speed levers, a Tiagra rear derailleur, and a compact double crank,
    paired with a set of Shimano RS wheels and Schwalbe Durano tires. The quill stem and polished
    dual pivot calipers keep the classic silhouette, with fresh black Shimano Pro bar tape and a GT saddle to finish it off.
  </p>

